{"seq":3,"slug":"economy-pricing","title":"定价与虚拟经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/economy-pricing","wordCount":1398,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"定价与虚拟经济\">定价与虚拟经济</h1><p>当一名玩家在商店里看到「648 元 = 6480 钻石」时，他正在和一套被精心设计过的虚拟经济打交道。这套经济决定了一颗钻石值多少钱、一把传说武器要攒多久、以及玩家是会觉得「物有所值」还是「被宰一刀」。虚拟经济不是商店里随手标的几个价签，而是一个需要像真实经济一样去调控通胀与流动性的系统——设计得糟糕，货币会贬值、稀缺会消失，整个付费动力随之崩塌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>绝大多数免费游戏采用双层货币结构：用真钱购买的硬通货（钻石、点券），与靠玩法产出的软通货（金币、经验）。两层之间通常单向流通——硬通货能换软通货，反之不行——以此守住付费的价值。而整个经济的健康，取决于产出（faucet，水龙头）与消耗（sink，下水道）是否平衡。下图勾勒这套循环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[真实货币] --&gt;|充值| B[硬通货&lt;br/&gt;钻石/点券]&#10;  B --&gt;|兑换| C[软通货&lt;br/&gt;金币/资源]&#10;  D[玩法产出 Faucet] --&gt;|每日任务/掉落| C&#10;  C --&gt; E[消耗 Sink]&#10;  B --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[强化/购买/抽卡]&#10;  E --&gt; G[损耗/维修/手续费]&#10;  F --&gt;|稀缺与追求| H[付费动力]&#10;  G --&gt;|回收货币| I[抑制通胀]\">flowchart TD\n  A[真实货币] --&gt;|充值| B[硬通货&lt;br/&gt;钻石/点券]\n  B --&gt;|兑换| C[软通货&lt;br/&gt;金币/资源]\n  D[玩法产出 Faucet] --&gt;|每日任务/掉落| C\n  C --&gt; E[消耗 Sink]\n  B --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[强化/购买/抽卡]\n  E --&gt; G[损耗/维修/手续费]\n  F --&gt;|稀缺与追求| H[付费动力]\n  G --&gt;|回收货币| I[抑制通胀]</pre><p>下表对比双层货币的设计意图，理解它们是定价的前提。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>硬通货</th>\n<th>软通货</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>主要靠充值</td>\n<td>主要靠玩法产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用途</td>\n<td>抽卡、稀有商品、加速</td>\n<td>日常强化、基础消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流通方向</td>\n<td>可换软通货</td>\n<td>不可换硬通货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设计目标</td>\n<td>维持付费价值</td>\n<td>维持日常活跃与消耗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"水龙头与下水道-经济平衡的核心\">水龙头与下水道：经济平衡的核心</h2><p>虚拟经济最容易出的问题是通货膨胀：玩法产出（水龙头）开得太大，而消耗（下水道）跟不上，软通货迅速贬值，玩家攒一座金山却无处可花，付费意愿随之崩塌。反过来，下水道开得太狠则会让玩家觉得处处掣肘、产生挫败。设单位时间净流入为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M = F - S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间产出、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位时间消耗。健康的成长型经济允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 略大于零，让玩家感到「越来越富」，但必须用持续升级的消耗点（更贵的强化、更高级的建筑、损耗与手续费）把多出来的货币不断回收，否则通胀失控。这套调控逻辑会在运营中长期监控，相关指标见<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/metrics-funnels\">核心指标与漏斗</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定价心理-锚定与诱饵\">定价心理：锚定与诱饵</h2><p>价格从来不是孤立的数字，玩家总是在比较中判断贵贱。最常用的两个手法是锚定与诱饵。锚定是先抛出一个高价选项，让旁边的中价选项显得划算——648 的超值大礼包让 30 元的小礼包看起来毫无压力。诱饵效应则是故意放一个明显不划算的选项，把玩家推向你真正想卖的那个。下表是一个典型的钻石档位设计，注意各档「每元所得」如何被刻意安排。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n<th>钻石</th>\n<th>每元钻石</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>微氪</td>\n<td>¥6</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>10.0</td>\n<td>入门、首充诱导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小氪</td>\n<td>¥30</td>\n<td>330</td>\n<td>11.0</td>\n<td>诱饵（性价比平平）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中氪</td>\n<td>¥98</td>\n<td>1180</td>\n<td>12.0</td>\n<td>主推档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大氪</td>\n<td>¥648</td>\n<td>8400</td>\n<td>12.96</td>\n<td>锚点 + 鲸鱼档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>越往高档每元所得越多，这既奖励大额付费，也用最高档为整个价目表设下锚点。这些定价手法在哪里落地为具体商品，见<a href=\"../monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods\">内购与虚拟商品</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区域定价与价格弹性\">区域定价与价格弹性</h2><p>同一件商品在不同国家不应该卖同一个数字。购买力差异巨大，把美区的定价直接换算成本币往往要么贵到没人买、要么便宜到丢钱。区域定价（按当地购买力与汇率调整价格）已是标准做法。其背后是价格弹性——需求量对价格变化的敏感度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{\\Delta Q / Q}{\\Delta P / P}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E| &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时需求富有弹性，降价带来的销量增长能抵过单价损失，适合走量；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E| &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时需求缺乏弹性，提价反而增收，常见于鲸鱼追逐的稀缺限定。理解弹性，才能为不同市场、不同商品定出各自合理的价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经济崩溃的常见诱因\">经济崩溃的常见诱因</h2><p>虚拟经济的失败往往不是单点失误，而是几个慢性病叠加：水龙头长期大于下水道导致软通货贬值；稀有道具被过度发放（活动撒币、补偿邮件）导致稀缺性消失；新版本的强力道具让旧付费内容瞬间贬值，伤害老玩家的付费信任。规避这些，需要运营持续监控货币存量与价格信号，并在每次版本更新时谨慎评估对存量经济的冲击——这与第三章<a href=\"../liveops/content-cadence\">内容更新与季节机制</a>的内容投放节奏直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>双层货币（硬通货 + 软通货）是免费游戏经济的基本结构，单向流通以守护付费价值。</li>\n<li>经济健康取决于产出（水龙头）与消耗（下水道）的平衡：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta M = F - S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，须用升级的消耗点回收货币抑制通胀。</li>\n<li>锚定与诱饵是核心定价心理；钻石档位常设计成「越大档每元所得越多」。</li>\n<li>区域定价依据购买力与价格弹性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 调整，弹性决定走量还是提价。</li>\n<li>通胀失控、稀缺消失、版本贬值是经济崩溃的三大诱因，须在运营中持续监控。</li>\n<li>本篇是 hub 内虚拟经济与定价心理的底座，后续内购与抽卡定价均建立其上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定价与虚拟经济","id":"定价与虚拟经济"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"水龙头与下水道：经济平衡的核心","id":"水龙头与下水道-经济平衡的核心"},{"level":2,"text":"定价心理：锚定与诱饵","id":"定价心理-锚定与诱饵"},{"level":2,"text":"区域定价与价格弹性","id":"区域定价与价格弹性"},{"level":2,"text":"经济崩溃的常见诱因","id":"经济崩溃的常见诱因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"玩家分层与 LTV","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/foundations/player-segments-ltv"},"next":{"title":"内购与虚拟商品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/iap-virtual-goods"}}